[en.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_ULTIMATUM]
Ultimatum

[en.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_ULTIMATUM_desc]
As the Changeling Ambassador encountered snowstorm after snowstorm, we began to realize that the weather in Hailberg was not a natural phenomenon, but rather the will of the reindeer’s refusal to cooperate.

[zh.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_ULTIMATUM]
最后通牒

[zh.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_ULTIMATUM_desc]
随着使臣幻形灵多次遭遇风雪，我们渐渐明白过来：海尔伯格的天气不是自然现象，而是驯鹿们的拒绝态度。

